              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Aquarian Age is a Japanese commercial collectible trading card game with constructed decks, character factions, and card-effect battles."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Aquarian Age developed as a Japanese trading card game line with related media and a long-running collectible card pool."
            }
          ]
        },
