              "text": "Two players bring constructed decks from the commercial card pool."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Use legal Aquarian Age cards and deck-building rules."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Japanese collectible trading card decks, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
